Up say "stoy"
~1
Bandit action ["drop weapon",Bandit,0,0,"revolver"]
? (canstand Bandit): Bandit setdammage 0 
Bandit SetUnitPos "Up"
~3
Bandit switchmove "FXStandSurUniv"
~1
bandit dowatch Up
@up distance bandit < 15
bandit say "Stoy1"
@up distance bandit < 10
"1" objstatus "DONE"; "2" objstatus "Active"; 
Up say "Stoy2"
[bandit] join Up
Bandit SetUnitPos "AUTO"
Bandit switchmove "Stand"
Bandit setcaptive true
Bandit SetUnitPos "AUTO"
exit